{ "data": { "text": "We assessed task-related functional connectivity using the CONN toolbox (http://www.nitrc.org/projects/conn; 63) in MATLAB.\n\nFor all second-level analyses, T-tests on Fisher's Z-transformed correlations were used to test for differences in functional connectivity between tasks.\n\nWe therefore extracted regions of interest (ROI; 10 mm spheres) based on peak activation clusters from the whole-brain analysis to explore further connections between these regions during the task.\n\nWe then conducted a series of seed-to-voxel and ROI-to-ROI analyses with the task-based data to assess pairwise correlations between the ROIs.\n\nFor each participant, the CONN toolbox computed global network efficiency—a graph theory measure that is increasingly used to assess the integrative capacity of complex systems. Global efficiency reflects effective information transfer or 'small-worldness' within a network of nodes (i.e., ROIs) and edges (i.e., correlations or 'paths' between nodes). It is mathematically expressed as the inverse of the average shortest path length in a graph G to all other nodes in the graph.\n\nFinally, we computed the correlation between global network efficiency and composite creativity scores.\n\nThe PCC and precuneus seeds also showed negative connectivity with regions of the ECN, including bilateral DLPFC and posterior parietal cortex; these regions also showed negative connectivity with salience network regions (bilateral insula and the ACC)." }, "annotations": [ { "result": [ { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 60, "end": 71, "text": "CONN toolbox", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Software" ] } }, { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 60, "end": 71, "text": "1", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Connectivity normalization", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 168, "end": 189, "text": "Fisher's Z-transformed", "labels": [ "Connectivity normalization — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Connectivity normalization", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 168, "end": 189, "text": "2", "labels": [ "Connectivity normalization — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Result aggregation", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 157, "end": 163, "text": "T-tests", "labels": [ "Result aggregation — Algorithm/Type" ] } }, { "from_name": "Result aggregation", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 157, "end": 163, "text": "6", "labels": [ "Result aggregation — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "ROI definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 331, "end": 343, "text": "10 mm spheres", "labels": [ "ROI definition — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "ROI definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 326, "end": 329, "text": "3", "labels": [ "ROI definition — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 676, "end": 699, "text": "pairwise correlations", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 676, "end": 699, "text": "1", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 751, "end": 762, "text": "CONN toolbox", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Software" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 786, "end": 809, "text": "global network efficiency", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 751, "end": 762, "text": "5", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph characteristics", "to_name": "t